    + Reject sign characters in UnicodeUnescaper hex values
    + Keep abbreviate and truncate off surrogate pair boundaries
    + Keep initials from splitting a supplementary code point
    + Fix int overflow in DurationFormatUtils.formatPeriod
    + Fix CsvUnescaper bounds error on a single quote field
    + LANG-1824: Fix Strings.replace overflow on large replacements
    + Classify supplementary code points in StringUtils is*
